    "abstract": "Parts figure for the outflow valve control installation showing the actuator, the accumulator, the forward duct and the clamping and cable tray hardware.",
    "sections": {
      "purpose": "This figure identifies the parts of the outflow valve control installation, including the actuator, the accumulator, the forward duct and the clamping hardware.",
      "figure_note": "The actuator at item 10 covers the single-motor and duplex standards under separate effectivity. The two are dimensionally similar and differ at the connector, which has four extra contacts on the duplex item; the connector is not shown separately because it is supplied with the actuator. The cushioned loop clamps at item 50 are used only where the second motor cable runs alongside the duct and are therefore post-modification only."
    },
